lock  commander of the castle garrison from  Dragonstone along with his son and a  dozen others she thought to be  suspicious it was said she screamed at  her husband and roof Armand so loudly  questioning him on what he knew of his  sister's crime that her shouts could be  heard echoing all through the walls of  Dragonstone she even sent men to drip  mark in pursuit of Elissa but the trail  had gone cold  Elissa had vanished somewhere in Pentos  fire and blood seems to imply that the  three dragon eggs that Elissa farmen  stole from Dragonstone were the eggs  that would eventually hatch into ragel  the Syrian and Rogan more evidence comes  in this same chapter when Rana flies her  own dragon dreamed fire to King's  Landing to tell her brother King  jaehaerys of what ELISA had done Raina  knew that it was a ship ELISA wanted not  the Dragons themselves it was most  likely that she would sell them for gold  the King's fear was that more dragons  would soon hatch who had no allegiance  to House Targaryen he worried that new  dragon Lords would appear to possibly  challenge them it was grand maester  Bennifer who suggested that the eggs may  in fact not hatch it was gold she wanted  gold to build a ship she will sell the  eggs they are worth a fleet of ships Jo  Harris had received his sister in his  sole arm with only grand maester  Bennifer present to bear witness to what  was said if those eggs should hatch  there will be another Dragon Lord in the  world one not of our own house they may  not have been aforesaid not away from  dragon stone the heat it is known some  dragon eggs simply turned to stone here  maester Bennifer reveals that it is  known that some dragon eggs merely  turned into stone went away from the  island something about dragon stone  facilitates their incubate  perhaps this is the reason that the  ancient Targaryen chose the spot  nevertheless if the Meister was correct  and the eggs did become stone this is  yet another hint that these are in fact  Danny's eggs King jaehaerys in the scene  goes on to say that some spice mongerer  in Pentos will soon be in possession of  three very expensive stones but King  jaehaerys had a plan for if the Dragons  did hatch they would watch the Free  Cities closely and if the hatchlings  should appear they would demand the  return of their stolen property if the  dragons were not returned  then their enemies in the east would  face the flames of dream fire and Verma  Thor but the Dragons never turned up  that is not until centuries later when  Daenerys Targaryen who was born on  Dragonstone herself hatched them in Khal  Drogo's funeral pyre if this theory is  correct Illyria was born in Pentos and  became extremely wealthy there no doubt  it was there he purchased the eggs which  had likely been in the city for more  than two centuries him telling Daenerys  that the eggs came from ash I was  probably no more than a spurious claim  meant to excite the young princess as  for ELISA farmen she would eventually  take on the alias Alice Westhill and  attempt to sail the sunset sea with the  help of Sir Eustace Hightower we will  save the fate of ELISA Farman for our  next video  Illyrio likely had no idea that Daenerys  Targaryen would somehow awaken the  dormant dragon eggs  Danny's ability to hatch dragon eggs  must in some way be related to the  Targaryen history of placing eggs in the  cribs of Targaryen babes for some reason  all the secrets of hatching dragons were  lost to the Targaryen over the ages but  hidden in the texts we can find many  hints check out my series understanding  the birth of Dragons for more details on  how I think Daenerys was able to birth  dragons into the world I believe it was  a combination of outside magical  influence and of course Daenerys his own  genetics that awoke the dormant dragon  eggs  proximity of someone with Valyrian blood  to the dragon eggs seems to be key here  this and no doubt relates back to  ancient Valyrian sorcery the magic that  bound the Valyrian dragon riders to  their dragons initially though it seems  obvious that Illyrio bought the dragon  eggs in Pentos it remains a mystery as  to whoever had them for the previous 200  years thank you guys for watching make  sure you like and subscribe for more  ideas of Ice and Fire if you enjoyed  this video consider supporting this  channel on patreon
 

